\paragraph{70B evaluation.}
\label{sec:70b-results}
On Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct (AWQ INT4), zero-shot S1 eliminates DR on SciERC (6.41\%\,$\to$\,0\%; R-F1 11.24, $+$0.09\,pp) with CF 3.50\% (from 0\% unconstrained).
